# filebouncer

Structural / metadata upload checks only. Not antivirus. Do not add malware signatures or ask for malware samples.

- Node ≥ 20, ESM, pnpm. Verify with `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm build`.
- Threat = finding. `ScanFailureError` = could not finish looking (`result.errors`). `FileBouncerError` = programmer mistake (throws).
- Omitted `scanners` defaults to `"all"`. `scanners: []` disables built-ins (use this to isolate `customScanners` in tests).
- Default `blockThreshold` is `"high"`. `failFast` stops only after `critical`, not `high`.
- `timeoutMs` is a soft budget between scanners; it does not cancel an in-flight `scan()`.
- Public API is `src/index.ts`. Do not expand it without an export + test.
- Follow CONTRIBUTING.md. Prefer generated buffers in tests; no committed malware.
